":true}],"targetGroups":["Vegan","Vegetarian","Adult (18 - 50 Years)","No Allergies","Gluten Free","Dairy Free"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Magnesium - Potassium - B6 - Taurine - Ionic Trace Minerals"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Energy - Endurance - Hydration - Muscle stamina - No muscle cramps"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested use: Take 4-6 tablets daily, depending on activity, divided with meals and before and after periods of physical activity. Take with large amounts of fluid."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Electrolyte Stamina is ideal for sports performance, people working in high temperatures, and anyone expecting to experience high levels of fluid loss. Vitamin B6 (P-5-P) and taurine help get magnesium into the cells more effectively to help reduce muscle cramps, maintain muscle stamina, and support ATP production and cardiovascular endurance."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For individuals who lose high amounts of electrolytes, we recommend also using Electrolyte Stamina Power Pak, Electrolyte Stamina Shot, Endure, Flavored ConcenTrace, Hydration I.V., Max-Hydrate, and 40,000 Volts! Electrolyte Concentrate."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warning: Accidental overdose of iron-containing products is a leading cause of fatal, poisoning in children under 6. Keep this product out of reach of children. In case of accidental overdose, call a doctor or poison control center immediately."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No known allergens. Gluten free."},{"type":"General St